      "message": "test: sock_tests: Handle partial reads in send_and_receive\n\nIn `sock_tests/send_and_receive`, replace a single `Recv` call with\none or more repeated calls, until the expected amount of data is read,\nand do the checks only afterwards.\nThere is no guarantee that the expected data is returned in one call,\neven if it is written in one `send()`, and even on a loopback\nconnection, hence the need for the loop.",
